@startuml getRemotePortAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getRemotePortAsync – Retrieve TCP Client Remote Port
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "TCP Client Interface" as tci #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - tcpClientUuid
end note

requestor -> tci: (tcpClientUuid)
activate tci

tci -> jd: read logical-termination-points
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> tci: TCP client LTP list
deactivate jd

note over tci
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Identify TCP client LTP using tcpClientUuid  
  - Access tcp-client-interface-configuration  
  - Read remote-port attribute  
  - Return remote port value  
  - Return undefined if not configured or not found
end note

tci --> requestor: remotePort | undefined
deactivate tci

@enduml
